OL,3,GNEWSATwo more unions join school
OL,4,Astrikes over academy plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Diocese of Lancaster said the
OL,7,Freforms, which would see three
OL,8,Fmulti-academy (MAT) trusts consolidated
OL,9,Finto a single trust, were aimed at
OL,10,F"strengthening and protecting Catholic
OL,11,Feducation".
